{"id":"615069","name":"南瓜豆沙卷","author":"琪_feXjZ8E2","authorId":"10602029","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/615069/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"南瓜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"豆沙馅","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"酵母粉","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"南瓜削皮切薄片。","img":"images/615069/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放入电煮锅里蒸熟。","img":"images/615069/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"蒸好的南瓜带些水分，刚好等下和面不用加水。","img":"images/615069/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"趁热把南瓜压成泥放稍微凉一些。","img":"images/615069/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"然后再放入面粉，酵母粉。","img":"images/615069/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"搅成大面絮。","img":"images/615069/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"再揉成光滑面团，然后发酵。","img":"images/615069/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"大约1个半小时发好的面团。","img":"images/615069/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"取出多揉揉排气。","img":"images/615069/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"准备红豆沙。","img":"images/615069/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"将面团擀成长方形。","img":"images/615069/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"将红豆沙抹匀于面皮(红豆沙用少许温开水调稀一点才好抹)。","img":"images/615069/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"然后将面皮卷起来。","img":"images/615069/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"分切成等小份。","img":"images/615069/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"放入蒸锅里再醒发20分钟，冷水锅起蒸15-20分钟。","img":"images/615069/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"蒸好的样子很满意，香甜暄软好吃。","img":"images/615069/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/615069/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/615069/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/615069/step_19.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}